# generator output (OUTPUT_DIR): ~60 MB for ACS alone -- regenerate it, don't commit it
out/

# ...but the web interface's TEST fixtures live in a directory of that name, and the bare
# `feedback_contents/` above matches it at any depth -- so a new fixture would be silently
# skipped by `git add`, pass locally and die in CI. Un-exclude the directory itself first:
# git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
!web-interface/tests/fixtures/content/feedback_contents/
!web-interface/tests/fixtures/content/feedback_contents/*
